            <div xml:id="d625">

                <pb facs="0648" n="638" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg638"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/4–2649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Canton</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Ludden</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-26T18:00:00-04:00">April 26, 1949—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>178. For Merchant from Butterworth. You should know ECA is diverting cotton
                    shipments from Shanghai and in process moving headquarters Canton-Hong Kong. If
                    further large expenditures Shanghai can in fact be obviated there wld be
                    substantial increase in sums available Formosa and other projects.
                    [Butterworth.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
